@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@accessToken = replace_with_user_access_token
@adminToken = replace_with_admin_access_token
@userId = fedb46b4-eae6-44a8-8abd-1739bb089611
@messageId = fedb46b4-eae6-44a8-8abd-1739bb089612
@revision = 0
@throughSequence = 0

### 管理员向指定 ACTIVE 用户发送测试通知；需要 messages:write
# 新的业务意图使用新键；网络重试复用同一个键及相同正文
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: cs-message-send-20261027-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": ["{{userId}}"],
  "title": "cs站内消息测试",
  "body": "这是一条用于检查轮询、已读和删除的测试消息。"
}

### 首次 revision=0；后续改为上次返回值。建议等待 60–70 秒再请求
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/messages/poll?revision={{revision}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 最新 20 条，序号降序；不自动标记已读
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 历史下一页：替换为上一页 nextBeforeSequence（为 null 时停止）
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/messages?beforeSequence=12&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 补增量消息：按序号升序，保存 nextAfterSequence 后继续
# 不要用这个接口同步旧消息的已读／删除变化；这些变化需要刷新当前列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/messages?afterSequence=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 仅未读
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/messages?unreadOnly=true&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 详情不自动已读
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 批量标记已读，最多 100 个不同的本人消息 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/messages/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ids": ["{{messageId}}"]}

### 全部已读：先把 throughSequence 改为此前 poll 返回的 latestSequence
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/messages/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"throughSequence": "{{throughSequence}}"}

### 删除后隐藏，未读数同步减少；重复删除返回 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/me/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
